{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity went through 7 eras that made them collapse and then adapt, travel with your motorcycle to discover what they were. From the normality of the forest, a global drought... to the technological triumph that made them survive the universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D arcade platform game that will challenge your abilities and reflexes. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through each level, demonstrating your skill, with progressive difficulty in each era, and collect gems to unlock the most difficult levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, avoid obstacles, or take advantage of them to achieve your goals, whether it's finishing early or being able to reach places you normally couldn't. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your speed with 3 base gears that will help you reach the goal and your objectives.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037070?t=1769253370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037070?t=1769253370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037070/75d4abf76c97fc7fb211b5347a949da424e99852/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769253370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037070/75d4abf76c97fc7fb211b5347a949da424e99852/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769253370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity went through 7 eras that made them collapse and then adapt, travel with your motorcycle to 